#: ../../doc/old/old/read/ir/source-map/Source.ipynb:30002
msgid "`SourceNode` 继承自 `Object` 类的子类，它表示程序源代码。该类具有以下成员变量和成员函数："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/ir/source-map/Source.ipynb:30004
msgid "`source_name`：`SourceName` 类型的成员变量，表示源名称。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/ir/source-map/Source.ipynb:30005
msgid "`source`：`String` 类型的成员变量，表示原始源代码。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/ir/source-map/Source.ipynb:30006
msgid ""
"`line_map`：`std::vector<std::pair<int, int>>` "
"类型的成员变量，表示行映射，将行号映射到原始源代码中的字符位置。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/ir/source-map/Source.ipynb:30007
msgid ""
"`VisitAttrs(AttrVisitor* "
"v)`：一个成员函数，用于访问属性。它接受一个指向`AttrVisitor`对象的指针作为参数，并依次调用`v->Visit(\"source_name\","
" &source_name)`、`v->Visit(\"source\", &source)`来访问相应的属性。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/ir/source-map/Source.ipynb:30008
msgid "`_type_key`：一个静态常量字符指针，表示该类型的键。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/ir/source-map/Source.ipynb:30009
msgid ""
"`TVM_DECLARE_FINAL_OBJECT_INFO(SourceNode, "
"Object)`：一个宏定义，用于声明`SourceNode`对象的最终信息。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/ir/source-map/Source.ipynb:30011
msgid "总体来说，这段代码定义了一个表示程序源代码的类，并提供了相应的属性访问功能。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/ir/source-map/Source.ipynb:40002
msgid "`Source`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/ir/source-map/Source.ipynb:50002
msgid "`Source` 类继承自 `ObjectRef` 类。该类具有以下成员函数："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/ir/source-map/Source.ipynb:50004
msgid ""
"`Source(SourceName src_name, std::string "
"source)`：一个构造函数，用于创建一个`Source`对象。它接受两个参数：`src_name`表示源名称，`source`表示源代码字符串。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/ir/source-map/Source.ipynb:50005
msgid ""
"`GetLine(int "
"line)`：一个成员函数，用于获取指定行号的源代码内容。它接受一个整数类型的参数`line`，表示要获取的行号，并返回一个`tvm::String`类型的结果，表示该行的源代码内容。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/ir/source-map/Source.ipynb:50006
msgid ""
"`TVM_DEFINE_NOTNULLABLE_OBJECT_REF_METHODS(Source, ObjectRef, "
"SourceNode)`：一个宏定义，用于定义`Source`对象的非空引用方法。"
msgstr ""

